1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,604
It hasn't rained in a week. So why is there a puddle in the middle of this road?

2
00:00:04,822 --> 00:00:08,108
One extra line in a forbidden scroll. One archive.

3
00:00:08,108 --> 00:00:14,746
And a boy who has read every mission report the Leaf ever filed, including the one about this puddle.

4
00:00:14,988 --> 00:00:17,562
[NARUTO] Sensei. It hasn't rained in a week.

5
00:00:17,698 --> 00:00:19,497
[KAKASHI] I know. Keep walking.

6
00:00:22,121 --> 00:00:27,712
Rewind four seconds. Naruto and Kakashi spot the puddle in the very same second.

7
00:00:27,712 --> 00:00:34,770
In canon, two ninja wait in a puddle exactly like this one, on a road where it hasn't rained in days.

8
00:00:35,021 --> 00:00:38,659
Neither of them breaks stride. Kakashi sets the pace.

9
00:00:38,659 --> 00:00:44,630
Naruto drops back one step, and a rock beside the road quietly turns out to be a clone.

10
00:00:44,889 --> 00:00:47,503
[SAKURA] Why are you walking like you're carrying a full bowl of soup?

11
00:00:47,649 --> 00:00:49,463
[NARUTO] Casual. I'm being casual.

12
00:00:49,606 --> 00:00:52,060
[SASUKE] That's the worst casual I've ever seen.

13
00:00:52,202 --> 00:00:54,906
[TAZUNA] Is it safe to stop? My feet hurt.

14
00:00:55,059 --> 00:00:59,484
[KAKASHI] Keep walking, Tazuna. Slowly. Like nothing's wrong.

15
00:00:59,615 --> 00:01:00,968
The puddle explodes.

16
00:01:00,968 --> 00:01:08,209
Two ninja in torn cloaks, one spiked chain between them, and Kakashi is wrapped up before anyone can blink.

17
00:01:08,445 --> 00:01:14,844
They tear him into four pieces. Sakura screams. Tazuna goes the color of old paper.

18
00:01:15,091 --> 00:01:16,525
[SAKURA] Kakashi-sensei!

19
00:01:16,676 --> 00:01:19,990
[NARUTO] It's a log. Look at the cut. There's bark on it.

20
00:01:20,139 --> 00:01:22,193
[CLONE] Boss, is it my turn yet?

21
00:01:22,315 --> 00:01:29,206
The brothers split. One lunges at Tazuna. The rock stops being a rock and takes the chain in the stomach.

22
00:01:29,206 --> 00:01:32,619
Pop. Naruto grunts, and keeps the memory of the hit.

23
00:01:32,865 --> 00:01:36,244
[NARUTO] Ow. Sasuke, the other one's coming from the left!

24
00:01:36,389 --> 00:01:37,318
[SASUKE] I see him.

25
00:01:37,446 --> 00:01:41,084
Sasuke slides in low and sweeps the brother's legs.

26
00:01:41,084 --> 00:01:49,145
Sakura plants herself in front of Tazuna, kunai in both fists. Naruto sits on the second brother before he lands.

27
00:01:49,404 --> 00:01:51,338
[SAKURA] Nobody touches him. Nobody!

28
00:01:51,453 --> 00:01:54,652
[TAZUNA] Nobody has ever said that about me before.

29
00:01:54,797 --> 00:01:59,879
[KAKASHI] Chunin of the Hidden Mist, tied up in under a minute. Not bad at all.

30
00:01:59,989 --> 00:02:02,228
[CLONE] Do I get a medal? I took a chain for you.

31
00:02:02,369 --> 00:02:04,063
[KAKASHI] The rock gets a footnote.

32
00:02:04,219 --> 00:02:11,168
[KAKASHI] Tazuna. Two chunin knew which road we'd take. That isn't a C-rank. Start talking.

33
00:02:11,301 --> 00:02:14,943
[TAZUNA] Gato. He owns every ship in the Land of Waves.

34
00:02:14,943 --> 00:02:18,110
[TAZUNA] My bridge would put him out of business.

35
00:02:18,239 --> 00:02:22,832
[TAZUNA] We couldn't pay for a higher rank. Nobody in my village could.

36
00:02:22,832 --> 00:02:25,573
[TAZUNA] So I called it a C-rank, and I hoped.

37
00:02:25,717 --> 00:02:28,919
In canon, Tazuna lies about the mission rank.

38
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:34,826
He pays C-rank prices and walks a team of children into a fight that was never a C.

39
00:02:35,046 --> 00:02:38,730
[NARUTO] You paid for a C-rank, old man. I've filed the price sheet.

40
00:02:38,851 --> 00:02:42,836
[NARUTO] An ambush by ninja is a B-rank at least. That's four times the price.

41
00:02:42,836 --> 00:02:45,782
[NARUTO] Don't worry, I'm not mad. I'm just writing it down.

42
00:02:45,935 --> 00:02:50,094
[TAZUNA] Four times? We don't have that. We barely have a bridge.

43
00:02:50,234 --> 00:02:52,503
[SAKURA] We can't just leave him, Kakashi-sensei.

44
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:54,254
[SASUKE] Hn. We're already here.

45
00:02:54,398 --> 00:03:01,017
[KAKASHI] Fine. The mission continues. Naruto and Tazuna can discuss the invoice later.

46
00:03:01,156 --> 00:03:04,570
[NARUTO] Nobody sends just two chunin. Somebody's sending a third.

47
00:03:07,191 --> 00:03:11,992
They cross the strait in a rowboat, engine off, oars wrapped in cloth.

48
00:03:11,992 --> 00:03:15,490
The mist is so thick Sakura can't see her own hand.

49
00:03:15,703 --> 00:03:18,367
[CLONE] Boss, I'm up the mast. I can't see anything either.

50
00:03:18,497 --> 00:03:21,781
[NARUTO] That's fine. Nobody can. That's the whole problem with mist.

51
00:03:21,937 --> 00:03:25,196
[TAZUNA] Please don't tip the boat. I can't swim.

52
00:03:25,343 --> 00:03:26,842
[SASUKE] Quiet. Row.

53
00:03:26,956 --> 00:03:29,698
Then something large spins out of the fog.

54
00:03:29,698 --> 00:03:37,400
A sword the size of a door buries itself in a tree, and a man in bandages lands on the hilt like it's his front porch.

55
00:03:37,648 --> 00:03:41,572
[KAKASHI] Zabuza Momochi. The Demon of the Hidden Mist.

56
00:03:41,692 --> 00:03:47,536
[ZABUZA] Kakashi of the Sharingan. Hand over the old man, and I'll let the brats walk.

57
00:03:47,681 --> 00:03:50,065
[KAKASHI] Afraid the paperwork's already signed.

58
00:03:50,198 --> 00:03:55,833
Kakashi lifts his headband. A red eye opens beneath it, three black marks spinning.

59
00:03:55,833 --> 00:04:00,042
Zabuza smiles behind the bandages. He's been waiting for this.

60
00:04:00,302 --> 00:04:06,123
Then Zabuza dissolves into mist, and the mist closes around Kakashi like a fist.

61
00:04:06,123 --> 00:04:12,016
Water gathers into a sphere. Kakashi is inside it, and Zabuza's hand is the lock.

62
00:04:12,241 --> 00:04:17,924
[ZABUZA] The Water Prison. Nobody breaks it. Run, brats. Take the old man and run.

63
00:04:18,061 --> 00:04:21,450
[KAKASHI] Run! Take Tazuna and get out of here!

64
00:04:21,577 --> 00:04:22,791
[SAKURA] We can't leave you in there!

65
00:04:22,949 --> 00:04:25,728
[SASUKE] He's too strong. We can't even see him.

66
00:04:25,871 --> 00:04:30,185
[NARUTO] I read four reports about this jutsu. Four. Every one of them says the same thing.

67
00:04:30,327 --> 00:04:33,117
[NARUTO] He can't move while he holds it. The prison needs his hand.

68
00:04:33,117 --> 00:04:34,961
[NARUTO] That's not a weakness. That's a handle.

69
00:04:35,072 --> 00:04:36,601
[SASUKE] So we make him let go.

70
00:04:36,761 --> 00:04:40,058
[NARUTO] Windmill shuriken, Sasuke. Just like the bell test.

71
00:04:40,058 --> 00:04:42,450
[NARUTO] Except this time, I'm the second one.

72
00:04:42,573 --> 00:04:46,687
[ZABUZA] Children's tricks. I've killed grown men who tried tricks.

73
00:04:46,822 --> 00:04:52,956
Sasuke throws a windmill shuriken, wide and loud. Zabuza snatches it out of the air.

74
00:04:52,956 --> 00:04:57,556
Hidden in its shadow is a second one, and that one isn't steel.

75
00:04:57,807 --> 00:05:03,448
In canon, Naruto turns into a shuriken against Zabuza here in the Land of Waves.

76
00:05:03,448 --> 00:05:06,691
This time the only person surprised is Zabuza.

77
00:05:06,892 --> 00:05:10,076
[TAZUNA] Did that boy just turn into a throwing star?

78
00:05:10,211 --> 00:05:11,890
[SAKURA] Yes. You'll get used to it.

79
00:05:12,020 --> 00:05:14,334
[ZABUZA] A shadow inside a shadow!

80
00:05:14,476 --> 00:05:18,825
Zabuza ducks the second shuriken. To do it, he has to move.

81
00:05:18,825 --> 00:05:21,995
And to move, he has to let go of the water.

82
00:05:22,252 --> 00:05:26,292
The prison bursts. Kakashi drops to the sand, gasping.

83
00:05:26,292 --> 00:05:31,081
Naruto lands beside him, human again, a kunai held in his teeth.

84
00:05:31,311 --> 00:05:33,125
[ZABUZA] That won't work twice, brat.

85
00:05:33,248 --> 00:05:35,082
[NARUTO] It's not borrowed. It's mine.

86
00:05:35,223 --> 00:05:39,000
[KAKASHI] He did it to me first. At the bell test.

87
00:05:39,119 --> 00:05:41,506
That's the thing about a trick you invented.

88
00:05:41,506 --> 00:05:45,683
It works even when they know it's coming. They just watch the wrong shuriken.

89
00:05:45,887 --> 00:05:51,054
Now Kakashi is free, and the Sharingan reads Zabuza a half second early.

90
00:05:51,054 --> 00:05:57,656
The Demon of the Mist is losing to his own sword. Then two needles whisper out of the trees.

91
00:05:57,872 --> 00:05:59,813
They sink into Zabuza's neck.

92
00:05:59,813 --> 00:06:03,696
He drops without a sound, and the whole shore goes silent.

93
00:06:03,927 --> 00:06:08,981
[HAKU] Thank you for your help. I've been hunting this one for a very long time.

94
00:06:09,099 --> 00:06:11,343
[KAKASHI] Then the Hidden Mist has our thanks.

95
00:06:11,491 --> 00:06:19,189
The masked hunter-nin lifts Zabuza onto his shoulder and turns to go. A hunter-nin destroys the body on the spot.

96
00:06:19,189 --> 00:06:24,570
Kakashi realizes that too late, in canon, after the masked boy is already gone.

97
00:06:24,775 --> 00:06:26,199
[NARUTO] Hey. Wait a second.

98
00:06:26,327 --> 00:06:29,146
[NARUTO] Page four. Real ones burn the body.

99
00:06:29,647 --> 00:06:33,872
The masked boy stops. For one second, nothing moves on the shore.

100
00:06:33,872 --> 00:06:38,551
Then he's a flicker of mist and a footprint, and the body goes with him.

101
00:06:38,809 --> 00:06:45,368
[KAKASHI] He's right. Hunter-nin of the Mist destroy the body at once. Zabuza is alive.

102
00:06:45,523 --> 00:06:48,491
Kakashi works it out one heartbeat later.

103
00:06:48,491 --> 00:06:52,617
Zabuza is alive, and the Leaf knows it a full week early.

104
00:06:52,823 --> 00:06:57,685
Then Kakashi's good eye closes and he drops to one knee, chakra empty.

105
00:06:57,685 --> 00:07:01,992
Sakura gets there first. He's out before she can say his name.

106
00:07:02,211 --> 00:07:04,655
[SAKURA] Sensei! Naruto, help me!

107
00:07:04,790 --> 00:07:06,004
[TAZUNA] Is he dead?

108
00:07:06,136 --> 00:07:08,665
[SAKURA] He's tired. There's a difference. Mostly.

109
00:07:08,794 --> 00:07:12,688
[NARUTO] A week for him to get up. A week for Zabuza to heal. So I've got a week.

110
00:07:15,318 --> 00:07:17,458
Kakashi sleeps for three days.

111
00:07:17,458 --> 00:07:23,807
Tazuna's bridge is a third built, with eleven workers left, and Naruto counts them twice.

112
00:07:24,062 --> 00:07:26,616
[NARUTO] Eleven men. At that rate it's done by winter.

113
00:07:26,764 --> 00:07:31,683
[TAZUNA] Eight months, if Gato's thugs leave us alone. They won't.

114
00:07:31,813 --> 00:07:34,892
[NARUTO] Eight months. Okay. That's a number I can work with.

115
00:07:35,015 --> 00:07:41,020
Three hundred orange kids pile out of the mist carrying more lumber than the village has seen in a year.

116
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:43,329
The foreman faints. A clone catches him.

117
00:07:43,545 --> 00:07:45,749
[TAZUNA] Just how many of you are there?

118
00:07:45,883 --> 00:07:47,117
[CLONE] Yes. All of us.

119
00:07:47,047 --> 00:07:48,891
[CLONE] Boss, where do the beams go?

120
00:07:49,047 --> 00:07:50,786
[NARUTO] Up! Where else would beams go?!

121
00:07:50,935 --> 00:07:52,739
[CLONE] Boss, we ran out of nails.

122
00:07:52,862 --> 00:07:55,164
[NARUTO] Then use the other nails! The ones we have!

123
00:07:55,301 --> 00:07:57,730
[CLONE] Boss. Clone sixty says the bridge is crooked.

124
00:07:57,864 --> 00:07:58,474
[NARUTO] Which way?

125
00:07:58,606 --> 00:07:59,930
[CLONE] Up. Definitely up.

126
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:01,754
[CLONE] Boss, I fell in the water.

127
00:08:01,896 --> 00:08:05,015
[NARUTO] I know! I just felt it! Stop falling in the water!

128
00:08:05,168 --> 00:08:08,653
Every four minutes, a clone falls off something.

129
00:08:08,653 --> 00:08:13,807
Every four minutes, Naruto is damp. By lunch, he gives up on being dry.

130
00:08:14,008 --> 00:08:19,095
Here's the arithmetic. Three hundred clones, ten hours a day, six days.

131
00:08:19,095 --> 00:08:24,827
Eighteen thousand hours of labor. Gato's plan needed this bridge to take months.

132
00:08:25,045 --> 00:08:34,250
And rule two never sleeps. So ten clones pop at the top of every hour, and the tiredness drips in like rain instead of falling like a roof.

133
00:08:34,250 --> 00:08:36,899
He's always tired. He's never flattened.

134
00:08:37,132 --> 00:08:38,041
[SAKURA] You look terrible.

135
00:08:38,151 --> 00:08:41,020
[NARUTO] I feel amazing. Everything hurts, but amazing.

136
00:08:41,175 --> 00:08:46,847
On day three, Kakashi limps out of bed with a lesson plan. Tree walking.

137
00:08:46,847 --> 00:08:53,544
Naruto raises a hand. Night one, a hundred clones, forty trees, one very annoyed owl.

138
00:08:53,785 --> 00:08:55,811
[KAKASHI] You already did tree walking.

139
00:08:55,971 --> 00:09:00,295
[NARUTO] Night one. Sasuke and Sakura did it by the second night. Ask them!

140
00:09:00,448 --> 00:09:01,797
[SASUKE] I did it by lunch.

141
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:03,889
[SAKURA] I did it before breakfast. You were asleep.

142
00:09:03,999 --> 00:09:10,003
[KAKASHI] Fine. Then I'll teach you something harder. How to fight inside mist.

143
00:09:10,143 --> 00:09:15,322
[KAKASHI] In mist you can't trust your eyes. So you put eyes where the enemy isn't looking.

144
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:20,019
[NARUTO] Sentries! Clones on every beam! Oh. Sorry. Did you finish?

145
00:09:20,168 --> 00:09:22,247
[KAKASHI] No. But you're right.

146
00:09:22,389 --> 00:09:25,259
Sasuke trains until his hands blister.

147
00:09:25,259 --> 00:09:30,168
Sakura learns one job and learns it well. The client stays alive.

148
00:09:30,397 --> 00:09:33,051
[SAKURA] Nobody touches Tazuna. Not even a mosquito.

149
00:09:33,197 --> 00:09:34,716
[TAZUNA] Is there a mosquito?

150
00:09:34,828 --> 00:09:38,890
Meanwhile, a small boy in a bucket hat watches from the dock.

151
00:09:38,890 --> 00:09:44,217
Inari has watched them work for four days. He hasn't spoken once. Today he does.

152
00:09:44,460 --> 00:09:48,914
[INARI] Why do you keep doing this? Gato's going to kill you. Heroes don't exist.

153
00:09:49,058 --> 00:09:51,432
[NARUTO] Wow. That's the fourth time you've said that.

154
00:09:51,586 --> 00:09:54,335
[INARI] Because it's true! People who try, die!

155
00:09:54,447 --> 00:09:58,571
[NARUTO] I know. I've read what happens when nobody comes. Whole shelves of it.

156
00:09:58,727 --> 00:10:01,633
[NARUTO] Look. I know what it's like when nobody shows up.

157
00:10:01,633 --> 00:10:03,886
[NARUTO] So I'm not going to be nobody for you.

158
00:10:04,024 --> 00:10:09,236
Inari watches a boy who simply will not stop. Day five. The hammer never slows.

159
00:10:09,236 --> 00:10:13,128
On the sixth morning, he picks up the other end of a plank.

160
00:10:13,370 --> 00:10:15,281
[INARI] You're holding it wrong.

161
00:10:15,406 --> 00:10:18,870
[NARUTO] Huh? Oh. Thanks. Hey, you're good at this.

162
00:10:18,980 --> 00:10:23,159
The last plank drops at sunset, months ahead of anyone's plan.

163
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:27,809
Naruto sits down on it and is asleep before the hammer stops ringing.

164
00:10:28,027 --> 00:10:32,528
Across the strait, a very rich man has just lost months of leverage.

165
00:10:32,528 --> 00:10:34,051
He doesn't know it yet.

166
00:10:36,686 --> 00:10:41,208
On the fourth day Naruto slips into the woods for one quiet minute.

167
00:10:41,208 --> 00:10:45,190
There are light steps behind him. Even. Weight on the toes.

168
00:10:45,448 --> 00:10:49,737
Nobody ever walked toward him, so he learned everyone who walked away.

169
00:10:49,737 --> 00:10:55,252
He's heard these steps once before, on the shore, the day a masked boy carried off a body.

170
00:10:55,486 --> 00:10:58,845
[NARUTO] You can come out. You're really quiet. That's how I know it's you.

171
00:10:58,966 --> 00:11:01,560
[HAKU] You heard me. Most people don't.

172
00:11:01,717 --> 00:11:06,600
A boy about his age kneels in the ferns, a basket of herbs in his lap.

173
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:12,181
No mask. Hair tied back. A gentle face that hasn't decided whether to be afraid.

174
00:11:12,428 --> 00:11:14,782
[HAKU] You're not what I expected.

175
00:11:14,893 --> 00:11:17,702
[NARUTO] Nobody says that after the first minute. It's a whole thing.

176
00:11:17,822 --> 00:11:19,126
[HAKU] My name is Haku.

177
00:11:19,250 --> 00:11:21,639
[NARUTO] Naruto. You knew that already.

178
00:11:21,769 --> 00:11:26,458
[HAKU] These are for someone who is hurt. He's been hurt a great deal.

179
00:11:26,615 --> 00:11:30,119
[NARUTO] I know who you picked them for. I know who you carried off that shore.

180
00:11:30,267 --> 00:11:31,896
[HAKU] Then why aren't you shouting?

181
00:11:32,015 --> 00:11:35,437
[NARUTO] Because you carry herbs the way Iruka-sensei carries my lunch.

182
00:11:35,437 --> 00:11:37,479
[NARUTO] Careful. I know that kind of careful.

183
00:11:37,626 --> 00:11:41,855
[HAKU] Do you have someone precious? Someone you would do anything to protect?

184
00:11:42,014 --> 00:11:44,571
[NARUTO] A teacher with a scar across his nose.

185
00:11:44,571 --> 00:11:47,733
[NARUTO] An old man who gave me a desk. And a lot of me.

186
00:11:47,867 --> 00:11:49,038
[HAKU] Then you understand.

187
00:11:49,038 --> 00:11:53,486
[HAKU] When a person has someone to protect, that is when they become truly strong.

188
00:11:53,613 --> 00:11:55,302
[NARUTO] Yeah. I think I do.

189
00:11:55,420 --> 00:12:00,264
[HAKU] He is the only person who ever needed me. Without him I am nothing.

190
00:12:00,375 --> 00:12:04,799
[NARUTO] That's a terrible thing to believe. I used to believe it too. Then somebody stayed.

191
00:12:04,951 --> 00:12:07,700
[HAKU] On the bridge, I will not hold back.

192
00:12:07,852 --> 00:12:10,511
[NARUTO] Neither will I. But I'd like you standing at the end of it.

193
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:16,500
Haku disappears into the ferns with his basket. Naruto kneels where he is for a long while.

194
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:22,009
He has just met someone as alone as he used to be, and he'll have to fight him anyway.

195
00:12:24,662 --> 00:12:30,461
Back on the second day, Naruto found the easiest way into a shipping company. Get delivered.

196
00:12:30,461 --> 00:12:37,646
Nine ledgers arrive at Gato Shipping in a returned crate. Nobody remembers ordering them. Accountants never check.

197
00:12:37,871 --> 00:12:40,035
[CLONE] Nobody sneeze. We're books.

198
00:12:39,965 --> 00:12:41,209
[CLONE] Books don't have noses.

199
00:12:41,139 --> 00:12:44,503
[CLONE] He's reading me. Upside down. Why is he reading me?

200
00:12:44,433 --> 00:12:45,807
[CLONE] Because that's how I'd read us!

201
00:12:45,933 --> 00:12:51,839
In the corner office, a short man in a small white suit counts coins that belong to other people.

202
00:12:51,839 --> 00:12:53,727
Two bodyguards guard the coins.

203
00:12:53,961 --> 00:12:55,910
[GATO] Where did these ledgers come from?

204
00:12:56,062 --> 00:12:58,826
[GATO] We have a returns department? Fire him.

205
00:12:58,947 --> 00:13:00,566
[CLONE] We're so good at this.

206
00:13:00,679 --> 00:13:02,038
[GATO] The bridge takes months.

207
00:13:02,038 --> 00:13:07,698
[GATO] By the time it's finished, Zabuza will have killed that old fool, and the whole country will owe me.

208
00:13:07,831 --> 00:13:11,461
[GATO] And when Zabuza's done, my men finish him.

209
00:13:11,461 --> 00:13:15,955
[GATO] Write it down. Zabuza Momochi. Disposal. No payment.

210
00:13:16,076 --> 00:13:21,333
An accountant opens the nearest ledger and writes it in ink, directly on the page.

211
00:13:21,333 --> 00:13:24,730
The clone beneath the page feels the nib. It tickles.

212
00:13:24,964 --> 00:13:27,726
In canon, Gato never meant to pay Zabuza.

213
00:13:27,726 --> 00:13:34,193
He planned to have him killed the moment the job was done. This time, someone has it in writing.

214
00:13:34,444 --> 00:13:36,952
At midnight the nine clones pop in a line,

215
00:13:36,952 --> 00:13:41,133
and a whole accounting department's memory comes home in one headache.

216
00:13:41,348 --> 00:13:43,987
[NARUTO] Sakura. I need you to read something.

217
00:13:44,105 --> 00:13:46,254
[SAKURA] Why me? Sasuke can read.

218
00:13:46,387 --> 00:13:47,436
[SASUKE] I read fine.

219
00:13:47,593 --> 00:13:49,564
[NARUTO] You read quiet. Sakura reads loud.

220
00:13:49,564 --> 00:13:56,522
[NARUTO] If Zabuza ever stops listening to Kakashi, I need someone to stand there and read him page nine at the top of her lungs.

221
00:13:56,648 --> 00:13:59,977
[SAKURA] That's the dumbest plan I've ever heard. Fine. I'll do it.

222
00:14:00,091 --> 00:14:04,390
On the last night he writes his report, the way he writes all of them now.

223
00:14:04,390 --> 00:14:10,955
At the bottom he signs, and in the margin there is a small crooked bowl of ramen. He doesn't notice he's done it.

224
00:14:11,171 --> 00:14:17,668
Kakashi notices. He reads the page twice. He looks at the margin for a long time and says nothing.

225
00:14:17,668 --> 00:14:21,580
Then he folds the page very carefully, like it might break.

226
00:14:21,821 --> 00:14:27,210
[KAKASHI] Zabuza will come at dawn. He's had his week. So have we.

227
00:14:27,369 --> 00:14:30,658
[NARUTO] Can't sleep. I've got three hundred clones to hide in buckets.

228
00:14:33,294 --> 00:14:38,984
Dawn. The bridge is finished, wet with mist, and the whole crew has been sent home.

229
00:14:38,984 --> 00:14:46,388
Naruto has not been idle. Three hundred clones stand on it as rope coils, planks, buckets, and one lunchbox.

230
00:14:46,604 --> 00:14:49,103
Tazuna waits at the far end with Sakura.

231
00:14:49,103 --> 00:14:53,163
And out of the white walks a man with a sword the size of a door.

232
00:14:53,403 --> 00:14:57,437
[ZABUZA] Kakashi. You look well for a man who was on the floor.

233
00:14:57,589 --> 00:14:59,667
[KAKASHI] You look well for a dead man.

234
00:14:59,812 --> 00:15:02,651
[ZABUZA] Haku. The little ones are yours.

235
00:15:02,808 --> 00:15:05,182
[HAKU] Yes, Zabuza-sama.

236
00:15:05,312 --> 00:15:10,763
Kakashi and Zabuza vanish into the fog. Steel rings on the left, then the right.

237
00:15:10,763 --> 00:15:14,851
You can't see either of them, but you can hear who's losing.

238
00:15:15,055 --> 00:15:18,578
Haku steps between two boys. The air goes cold.

239
00:15:18,578 --> 00:15:25,024
Ice mirrors rise in a dome around Naruto and Sasuke, and each one shows a masked face.

240
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:26,704
[SASUKE] Ice. Great.

241
00:15:26,842 --> 00:15:29,546
[HAKU] I don't want to hurt you. But I will.

242
00:15:29,659 --> 00:15:35,515
He steps into one mirror, and he's in all of them. Needles rain down from every angle.

243
00:15:35,515 --> 00:15:41,098
Sasuke steps in front of Naruto and takes it across his arms, his chest, his back.

244
00:15:41,342 --> 00:15:42,481
[SASUKE] Stay behind me.

245
00:15:42,612 --> 00:15:44,601
[NARUTO] Sasuke! Your arms!

246
00:15:44,737 --> 00:15:46,976
[SASUKE] Don't you dare. I'm fine.

247
00:15:47,106 --> 00:15:50,725
[SASUKE] Just watch the mirrors. Tell me what you see.

248
00:15:50,868 --> 00:15:55,147
[HAKU] Whoever stands in front takes the pain. It's an old mistake.

249
00:15:55,262 --> 00:15:58,476
[NARUTO] He's too fast. He's faster than one pair of eyes.

250
00:15:58,622 --> 00:16:00,286
[NARUTO] He can't be faster than a thousand.

251
00:16:00,409 --> 00:16:03,719
Batches of ten. It was the first rule he ever made.

252
00:16:03,719 --> 00:16:10,273
Three hundred clones at once is the one thing he swore he'd never do. He's about to do it on purpose.

253
00:16:10,785 --> 00:16:16,654
[KURAMA] Three hundred memories at once, brat. Your skull is not that big.

254
00:16:16,777 --> 00:16:18,781
[NARUTO] Then it only has to hold for three seconds.

255
00:16:18,909 --> 00:16:21,038
[NARUTO] You can't be faster than a thousand eyes!

256
00:16:21,198 --> 00:16:30,467
Three hundred clones pop at once. Every shadow clone returns its memory, and three hundred copies of the same three seconds come home together.

257
00:16:30,467 --> 00:16:33,967
In canon, nobody tells Naruto that until he's sixteen.

258
00:16:34,491 --> 00:16:42,476
From the rafters, the rail, the planks, the lunchbox. Three hundred angles on one dome of ice. Eight mirrors only copy Haku.

259
00:16:42,476 --> 00:16:50,140
One is where the boy actually stands. From the inside that's invisible. From out there, it's the only thing that moves.

260
00:16:50,389 --> 00:16:55,863
[NARUTO] Sasuke! Third from the rail! The one with the chip in the top corner! That's him!

261
00:16:56,020 --> 00:17:00,086
The tiredness of three hundred clones arrives all at once.

262
00:17:00,086 --> 00:17:02,399
Naruto folds like a dropped coat.

263
00:17:02,985 --> 00:17:05,064
[SASUKE] Dead last. You idiot.

264
00:17:05,220 --> 00:17:09,977
Sasuke's eyes burn red. The Sharingan, awake for the first time.

265
00:17:09,977 --> 00:17:15,329
In a dome of identical ice, one boy has been told exactly where to look.

266
00:17:15,564 --> 00:17:20,443
He ignores the needles. He throws one kunai, at the mirror Naruto named.

267
00:17:20,443 --> 00:17:24,713
The ice cracks open and a masked boy drops out of it, bleeding.

268
00:17:24,914 --> 00:17:28,688
[HAKU] Impossible. Nobody finds the true mirror.

269
00:17:28,801 --> 00:17:29,530
[SASUKE] He did it.

270
00:17:29,738 --> 00:17:33,670
Out in the fog, Sakura holds her ground beside Tazuna.

271
00:17:33,670 --> 00:17:37,602
Blades crash. Kakashi's hand crackles with blue light.

272
00:17:37,811 --> 00:17:40,795
[TAZUNA] Is it over? Please tell me it's over.

273
00:17:40,949 --> 00:17:43,823
[SAKURA] No. Stay behind me. I'm not done.

274
00:17:43,979 --> 00:17:45,749
Sakura makes up her mind.

275
00:17:45,749 --> 00:17:51,908
She opens the page she's carried for two days, steps out from behind Tazuna, and reads.

276
00:17:52,132 --> 00:17:57,471
[SAKURA] Gato Shipping, ledger nine! Zabuza Momochi! Disposal! No payment!

277
00:17:57,601 --> 00:18:01,250
[SAKURA] He's going to have his men kill you once the job's done! It's in his own books!

278
00:18:01,399 --> 00:18:02,848
[ZABUZA] What did you say, girl?

279
00:18:02,965 --> 00:18:07,648
Zabuza's sword stops. It's the first time it has stopped all morning.

280
00:18:07,648 --> 00:18:13,349
He takes the page she holds out and reads it for himself. Gato's seal. His own name.

281
00:18:13,900 --> 00:18:16,944
But Kakashi's Lightning Blade is already running.

282
00:18:16,944 --> 00:18:21,044
Haku, bleeding, throws himself between them to protect his master.

283
00:18:21,285 --> 00:18:23,799
[ZABUZA] Hold it, Kakashi. Not him.

284
00:18:23,931 --> 00:18:25,905
[KAKASHI] I'm already stopping.

285
00:18:26,036 --> 00:18:30,328
The Lightning Blade stops one hand's width from Haku's chest.

286
00:18:30,328 --> 00:18:35,535
Blue sparks crackle against a cracked mask. And Zabuza's blade is lowered.

287
00:18:36,058 --> 00:18:38,743
[ZABUZA] Read the rest of it, girl. Out loud.

288
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:41,676
Then slow applause rolls across the bridge.

289
00:18:41,676 --> 00:18:48,749
Gato arrives at the head of a hundred hired swords, in a small white suit, and finds a very finished bridge.

290
00:18:48,997 --> 00:18:53,172
[GATO] Six days? Six days?! It was supposed to take months!

291
00:18:53,332 --> 00:18:59,111
[GATO] Zabuza! Why are these children still breathing? I'm not paying you to talk!

292
00:18:59,224 --> 00:19:02,188
[ZABUZA] You aren't paying me at all. Page nine.

293
00:19:02,343 --> 00:19:09,731
A hundred hired swords look at the Demon of the Hidden Mist, then at each other, then at the very long walk home.

294
00:19:09,731 --> 00:19:14,242
They run. Gato runs faster. Nobody has ever crossed a bridge quicker.

295
00:19:14,476 --> 00:19:19,515
[ZABUZA] We're done here. I don't fight for free. Haku, we're leaving.

296
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:21,749
[HAKU] Yes, Zabuza-sama.

297
00:19:21,865 --> 00:19:25,454
[HAKU] Tell the boy he saw true. Tell him thank you.

298
00:19:25,611 --> 00:19:28,245
[SASUKE] Hn. Tell him yourself. Later.

299
00:19:28,369 --> 00:19:31,862
Zabuza and Haku walk back into the mist alive.

300
00:19:31,862 --> 00:19:37,938
A page of Gato's ledger blows across the bridge, read by everyone who needed to.

301
00:19:38,176 --> 00:19:39,923
Naruto misses all of it.

302
00:19:39,923 --> 00:19:45,530
Nineteen hours later he wakes in Tazuna's house, with a seagull on his chest.

303
00:19:45,785 --> 00:19:49,908
In canon, clone fatigue stacks on the user, all at once.

304
00:19:49,908 --> 00:19:54,619
Fifty clones for an hour was a warning. Three hundred is a bill.

305
00:19:54,820 --> 00:19:57,344
[NARUTO] Ugh. Why is there a seagull on my chest?

306
00:19:57,503 --> 00:19:59,552
[SAKURA] It's been there since noon. We named it.

307
00:19:59,697 --> 00:20:01,716
[NARUTO] Did it work? Is everybody alive?

308
00:20:01,865 --> 00:20:03,919
[SASUKE] I hit it. Don't make it a thing.

309
00:20:04,058 --> 00:20:09,362
[KAKASHI] Everyone's alive. That includes Zabuza and Haku.

310
00:20:09,506 --> 00:20:13,992
[KAKASHI] My Lightning Blade stopped a hand's width from Haku.

311
00:20:13,992 --> 00:20:17,270
[KAKASHI] Zabuza had already read Sakura's page.

312
00:20:17,416 --> 00:20:19,240
[NARUTO] He read it. Good.

313
00:20:19,352 --> 00:20:21,151
[NARUTO] Nobody burned a body this time.

314
00:20:21,284 --> 00:20:23,163
[KAKASHI] No. Nobody did.

315
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:27,579
[TAZUNA] The bridge is finished. The whole country has crossed it twice.

316
00:20:27,579 --> 00:20:29,694
[TAZUNA] We'd like to name it after you.

317
00:20:29,805 --> 00:20:32,164
[NARUTO] Great! Call it Ichiraku!

318
00:20:32,321 --> 00:20:35,320
[INARI] It's already painted. The Great Naruto Bridge.

319
00:20:35,444 --> 00:20:39,659
Three days later the team is home, and the paperwork is waiting.

320
00:20:39,659 --> 00:20:44,863
A cat report. And a stack of Chunin exam registration forms taller than Sakura.

321
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:48,084
He signs the first one with a quick flourish.

322
00:20:48,084 --> 00:20:52,224
In the margin, a small ramen bowl appears. Nobody mentions it.

323
00:20:52,483 --> 00:20:55,432
[CLONE] Boss. This guy's failed the exam seven times.

324
00:20:55,556 --> 00:20:59,440
[NARUTO] Seven? Nobody's that bad at anything. Pull his file.

